Now the game.js. Write in parts. Part 1: constants/state/utils/cards/chips/render basics. Part 2: game flow. Let me be careful.

Key IDs. Let me write the full file in a few edits.

Important: valid HTML/CSS syntax. Now JS.

Plan:

```js
(() => {
'use strict';
const $ = ...
const CHIPS = [1,5,25,100,500]
const RANKS...
const state = {...}

// elements cache
// audio
