- `flyChip` from the clicked slot to the bet stack. Compute start/target rects at click time; target is the player bet zone. Add to body. Animate.

Sound on chip click.

- Deal:
```
async function dealRound() {
  if (state.phase !== 'bet' || state.busy || state.bet <= 0) return;
  state.busy = true;
  state.phase = 'dealing';
  state.round++;
  state.bankroll -= state.bet;
  updateBankroll();
  state.hands = {player:[],...};
  clear table? containers empty from nextRound.
  hide banner; clear bubbles; clear totals markup.
  // AI bets
  for each ai: choose bet, subtract bank, render bet stacks
  setPhaseUI();
  ensureShoe();
  // deal
  for pass 0..1: for seat in ['player','left','right','dealer']:
      await dealCardTo(seat, pass===1 && seat==='dealer');
      await wait(190);
  state.phase = 'player'; state.busy=false; setActive('player'); updateUI; hint...
  if player BJ: bubble BLACKJACK; await wait(700); stand();
}
```
Wait: for pass 0, dealer gets one up card. Second pass dealer hidden. Good.

State dealerHidden set when hidden card dealt.

`updateTotals` hides totals during dealing until at least one card; shows after.

The dealer total during deal: only visible first card, but the placeholder shows "10 + ?" if hidden. Actually only 1 visible card until second pass. After the hole card, show visible total + "?".

Implement:
```
function renderTotal(seat){
  const cards = state.hands[seat];
  if (!cards.length) hide;
  if (seat==='dealer' && state.dealerHidden) {
    const v = evalHand(cards.slice(0,1));
    el.innerHTML = `${v.total}<span class="q">+?</span>`;
    el.classList.add('show');
  } else { ... }
}
```
Note: if the dealer's first card is an Ace, visible total shows 11 with +?. Fine.

When blackjack: class is-blackjack and total 21.
Bust: is-bust.

- `dealCardTo(seat, hidden)` draws, pushes, appends card, animates from shoe. If dealer hidden, card element is back. `state.hiddenCardEl = el`.
Use `requestAnimationFrame` to ensure rects after append. The animation: get final rect, shoe rect. From the shoe center, animate transform from dx to 0. Because `.card` uses normal layout and flex; transform doesn't affect layout.

```js
function animateDeal(el){
  const shoe = $('#shoe').getBoundingClientRect();
  const r = el.getBoundingClientRect();
  const dx = (shoe.left + shoe.width/2) - (r.left + r.width/2);
  const dy = (shoe.top + shoe.height/2) - (r.top + r.height/2);
  el.animate([{transform:`translate(${dx}px,${dy}px) rotate(${-18}deg) scale(.82)`, opacity:.2, filter:'brightness(1.4)'}, {transform:'none', opacity:1, filter:'brightness(1)'}], {duration:360, easing:'cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)'});
}
```
Need `el.getBoundingClientRect()` after appended; r may include animation? fine.

- Reveal hidden card:
```
async function revealDealer(){
  if (!state.dealerHidden) return;
  state.dealerHidden = false;
  const el = state.hiddenCardEl; const card = state.hands.dealer[1];
  if (el) {
    const anim = el.animate([{transform:'rotateY(0)'},{transform:'rotateY(90deg)'}],{duration:170,easing:'ease-in',fill:'forwards'});
    await anim.finished;
    const newEl = makeCardEl(card);
    newEl.style.transform='rotateY(-90deg)';
    el.replaceWith(newEl);
    newEl.animate([{transform:'rotateY(-90deg)'},{transform:'rotateY(0)'}],{duration:240,easing:'ease-out'});
    state.hiddenCardEl = null;
  }
  updateTotals();
}
```
Since `.cards` has perspective. Good. Note the card state (hidden flag) is irrelevant as state has the real card.

- AI turn: `turnForSeat(seat)`:
