`settle(seat)`:
```
const p = evalHand(hands[seat]); const d = dealerHand;
let bet = ...; let payout=0, outcome, net=0;
if (p.bust) lose
else if (p.blackjack && !d.blackjack) { payout = bet*2.5; net = bet*1.5; outcome='blackjack' }
else if (p.blackjack && d.blackjack) push
else if (d.blackjack) lose
else if (d.bust || p.total > d.total) win payout bet*2 net +bet
else if (p.total === d.total) push payout bet
else lose
```
Blackjack when player has 21 with 2 cards, even after split (no splits). Fine.

- Add payouts to bankroll/AI banks. For player, show banner:
