Banner also maybe include dealer total? sub text includes e.g. "Dealer 19 · You 20"? Better sub: `+$50 · Dealer 19`. Keep simple.

AI bubbles: blackjack "BLACKJACK +$X", win `WIN +$50`, etc. Bubbles are small though. Use "WIN", "BUST", "PUSH", "BLACKJACK".

